{"id":"vod_lz_145180","vodId":"145180","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"梅比乌斯之尘","name_cn":"梅比乌斯之尘","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20260710-1/61b22ba7e93c9162ad4a86c0541fdd92.webp"},"summary":"陨石坠落后的第十年，由于巨大结晶释放出的神秘粒子“梅比乌斯之尘”的影响，一部分孩子获得了名为“拉姆斯”的特殊能力。这些特殊能力者由于生存范围受到限制，被禁止离开“新胜鹿镇”。为了排解无法离开的烦闷，高中生荒木与妹妹斯特拉、青梅竹马奥尔加等人组成“警跃者”队伍，运用异能全身心投入到争夺领地的游戏中。然而，直到有一天，“拉姆斯”的研究者汤田博士请求他们协助一项实验，荒木等人决定参与其中，他们的命运由此开始转动。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-09 00:28:19","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260710/8158_60f8aaa7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260716/8530_6435a973/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260724/8866_80c20bb0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260731/9132_dd5da3bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260806/9452_dd18608c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260813/9772_1a56d44f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260820/10259_c871436c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260827/10613_0bd35b85/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260903/10938_2bb83b4d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260911/11213_97d80af0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260918/11551_01f1d3cf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260924/11878_3fb1032c/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:12.331Z"}